# The champion economy carrying the riposte: Austin's counter-punch on
# the arm that can afford it. The fortress screen showed the riposte never
# arming because fortress goals ate the economy that funds the horde
# (screen-vh9n, log 2026-07-31) -- so the trigger rides the arty+raid
# champion instead, whole reserve released on the intruder-gone edge.

name riposte-champ
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,hoverTank,c_artillery
heavies none
max_workers 8
mass 25
reserve -1
expand 1
counter 1
cover 0
intercept 1
guard_cap 0
aa_cover 0
forward 0
scout 0
raid 3
rush 0
creep 0
riposte 1
tech 0
